===Etymology===
Composed of [[Ekavian]] Serbo-Croatian {{m|sh|bȅo||white}} (from {{der|sh|sla-pro|*bělъ}}) and {{m|sh|grȃd||city}} (from {{der|sh|sla-pro|*gordъ}}). The city is named after the white wall of the fortress that enclosed the city.

